#: ../../CHANGES.rst:58 810601a9070e4d36b65e3f2dc7c63c2c
msgid ""
"OIDC clients can be owned by users or groups. Users with the "
"``MANAGE_OWN_CLIENTS`` permission can create clients and manage the ones "
"they own. This permission is not granted by default. :issue:`308`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../CHANGES.rst:61 b96752cbdcab4b2caf4c1376f001ccc2
msgid ""
"Users who can manage all groups can pick the members of a group when they "
"create it, and add several users at once to an existing group. :issue:`192`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../CHANGES.rst:63 1413f13f1c4448d7bdbaf186d12f5c17
msgid ""
"Groups can have several owners. Owners can choose the other owners among the "
"members, invite users as owners, remove the members who are not owners, and "
"step down. Only users who can manage all groups can remove the other owners. "
"A group can only be deleted by its only owner. :issue:`309`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../CHANGES.rst:67 31e0bbe6756c4721997ac2fcecf15e83
msgid ""
"Profile photos can be uploaded in the PNG and WEBP formats, in addition to "
"JPEG. Their metadata, such as the GPS coordinates of smartphone photos, are "
"removed. They are downscaled to 1024x1024 and cannot weigh more than 5MB. On "
"the LDAP backend, they are converted to JPEG."
msgstr ""

#: ../../CHANGES.rst:71 f8ddf56bcad54110b03f2cc7c25eb946
msgid "Support for SCIM bulk operations, filtering and sorting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../CHANGES.rst:72 c504bf7e140744c9a9bb3dfe5c5d9940
msgid ""
"The token introspection and revocation endpoints accept the "
"``client_secret_post`` and ``private_key_jwt`` client authentication methods."
msgstr ""

#: ../../CHANGES.rst:77 4dea0647581c4e55b876f9e0424a708a
msgid ""
"Group invitation links ask for a confirmation before the user joins the "
"group."
msgstr ""

#: ../../CHANGES.rst:78 e06126aa564045cbb42fe4f548ba37f1
msgid ""
"Groups are picked with a search field in the user invitation and account "
"settings forms, also without JavaScript. The pages stay light with many "
"groups."
msgstr ""

#: ../../CHANGES.rst:80 2f592016730a40dda125f7fec03e2fe7
msgid ""
"Form fields are checked when the user leaves them, instead of while they "
"type, except for the password strength. Characters typed during a check no "
"longer get lost."
msgstr ""

#: ../../CHANGES.rst:83 364942c750e541a1af09518862ebd981
msgid ""
"Disabling :attr:`~canaille.core.configuration.CoreSettings.ENABLE_PASSWORD_RECOVERY` "
"also disables password initialization, which led to an unreachable page. "
"Administrators can still set passwords from the user profile."
msgstr ""

#: ../../CHANGES.rst:87 9168c0c19bff43a8bf75b43a81731ecc
msgid ""
"The session cookie is only sent with same-site requests by default "
"(``SESSION_COOKIE_SAMESITE`` is ``Lax``), also without the ``front`` extras."
msgstr ""

#: ../../CHANGES.rst:89 7290908bca2b4d1b88f8346ee4b9a301
msgid ""
"When ``LOGGING`` is a dictionary, the loggers that exist before Canaille "
"starts are no longer disabled. Set ``disable_existing_loggers`` to ``true`` "
"to disable them again."
msgstr ""

#: ../../CHANGES.rst:92 a73ffc6d9ba74021a85cf6bbc0af1e7d
msgid ""
"The HTTPS certificates of the outgoing requests, such as the password "
"compromise check and the download of ``request_uri`` and ``jwks_uri`` "
"documents, are checked against the system trust store instead of the certifi "
"bundle."
msgstr ""

#: ../../CHANGES.rst:95 83856cf1ae2c4804a3eee01ac87f3e9e
msgid ""
"A client management request with a token issued to another client answers "
"``400 access_denied`` instead of ``403 unauthorized_client``."
msgstr ""

