"token. Canaille issues this token for the client itself: the token has the "
"client as audience, has no user, and expires after one hour. To check the "
"token, the client calls the :rfc:`introspection endpoint <7662>` of "
"Canaille, ``/oauth/introspect``, with its own client credentials. The "
"introspection response is active while the token is valid."
