#: ../howtos/sso.rst:316 afd92ae24e524c8cbcf7d7bd6e660c4e
msgid ""
"Request the ``groups`` scope: Canaille then adds a ``groups`` claim to both "
"the ID token and the userinfo response, containing the list of the user's "
"group :attr:`display names <canaille.core.models.Group.display_name>`, for "
"instance:"
msgstr ""

#: ../howtos/sso.rst:325 5cdf3e64a10548d7a92d090c12d2434c
msgid ""
"Map this claim to your application's roles or permissions. Every application "
"does this differently (an attribute path, a role-mapping table, an allowed-"
"groups list…): look for *\"OIDC group mapping\"* or *\"role mapping\"* in "
"your application's documentation."
msgstr ""

#: ../howtos/sso.rst:329 ae0b2517cd5a4e51bf447c1652bc511d
msgid "Customizing the claims"
msgstr ""

