"**Can I?**, as in *Can I access your data?* Canaille is a lightweight "
"identity and authorization management software. It aims to be very light, "
"simple to install and simple to maintain. It is **self-hosted** and **free "
"and open source**: your users' identity data stays on your own "
"infrastructure, and every feature lives in the MIT-licensed core — no "
"paywalled edition, no proprietary add-on."
